# SPA fallback: every unmatched path serves index.html with a 200 status.
# Without this the host falls through to 404.html, which renders correctly
# but responds HTTP 404 — bad for search indexing and rejected outright by
# some link-preview bots.
#
# Real files (assets, css, js) are matched before this rule, so they are
# unaffected.
/*  /index.html  200
